WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:22.260
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:22.530 --> 00:23.460
Sai Jinyin,

3
00:24.160 --> 00:26.920
a woman in the con business like you,

4
00:27.000 --> 00:29.850
why would you sell your own daughter?

5
00:30.440 --> 00:31.510
Sir,

6
00:31.630 --> 00:33.160
what are you talking about?

7
00:33.270 --> 00:34.800
Kids

8
00:34.820 --> 00:36.640
don't come cheap.

9
00:36.790 --> 00:38.740
Food and daily necessities—

10
00:38.830 --> 00:40.510
every single thing costs money.

11
00:40.510 --> 00:41.040
She is...

12
00:42.230 --> 00:43.960
She's your own flesh and blood.

13
00:43.980 --> 00:45.380
Of course, she is.

14
00:47.660 --> 00:48.620
Sir,

15
00:48.790 --> 00:50.790
just look at the two of us.

16
00:50.950 --> 00:53.150
These eyes, these eyebrows, and this little nose.

17
00:53.150 --> 00:54.700
This little girl

18
00:55.020 --> 00:57.270
is the spitting image of me.

19
00:58.270 --> 01:00.230
Look how young she is.

20
01:00.590 --> 01:01.590
She's perfect.

21
01:03.270 --> 01:03.990
You smudged it again.

22
01:03.990 --> 01:04.650
Hold still.

23
01:06.660 --> 01:08.590
You little brat, stop right there!

24
01:11.070 --> 01:11.950
Stop!

25
01:14.180 --> 01:15.630
I said stop!

26
01:26.020 --> 01:27.230
Why won't you listen?

27
01:27.950 --> 01:29.539
I asked why you wouldn't listen!

28
01:29.539 --> 01:30.710
Why won't you listen?

29
01:30.710 --> 01:32.539
Is this how it's going to be every day?

30
01:32.539 --> 01:33.900
Is it?

31
01:34.990 --> 01:36.350
I told you to listen!

32
01:59.020 --> 01:59.950
Run!

33
01:59.950 --> 02:02.020
Let's see you run now!

34
02:02.900 --> 02:04.180
Let's see where you can run to!

35
02:04.180 --> 02:05.540
I'll break your legs!

36
04:27.080 --> 04:30.850
[A Prophet]

37
04:31.540 --> 04:33.860
[Episode 16]

38
04:47.190 --> 04:49.070
I left the mortal world to practice physiognomy.

39
04:49.070 --> 04:51.430
I left the mortal world to practice physiognomy.

40
04:51.430 --> 04:53.340
Everything in the mortal world is already in the past.

41
04:53.340 --> 04:55.700
Everything in the mortal world is already in the past.

42
04:55.700 --> 04:57.750
Thunder may strike, and fire may burn, but the wind cannot be driven away.

43
04:57.750 --> 04:59.990
Thunder may strike, and fire may burn, but the wind cannot be driven away.

44
04:59.990 --> 05:02.510
Life after life, I belong to the physiognomy sect.

45
05:02.510 --> 05:05.310
Life after life, I belong to the physiognomy sect.

46
05:07.110 --> 05:08.710
Once you light this incense,

47
05:08.750 --> 05:11.670
you are members of the Tianxiang Sect.

48
05:12.020 --> 05:13.380
Now that you've entered the sect,

49
05:13.380 --> 05:15.070
I have a word for you.

50
05:15.140 --> 05:18.020
Every single one of us in Yuehaitang

51
05:18.460 --> 05:19.580
is

52
05:19.900 --> 05:22.070
a capable woman outside.

53
05:22.220 --> 05:23.990
We owe all our blessings today

54
05:24.110 --> 05:25.990
to the grandmaster.

55
05:26.310 --> 05:28.630
-Thank you, Grandmaster. -Thank you, Grandmaster.

56
05:28.630 --> 05:30.560
Why do you join the Tianxiang Sect?

57
05:30.700 --> 05:32.190
I couldn't bear a child

58
05:32.310 --> 05:33.710
for my husband's family.

59
05:33.900 --> 05:35.990
So my husband threw me out.

60
05:36.140 --> 05:37.550
My own family despised my poverty

61
05:37.550 --> 05:39.080
and refused to take me back.

62
05:39.820 --> 05:41.480
I truly had nowhere else to go.

63
05:42.020 --> 05:42.700
Senior,

64
05:42.900 --> 05:43.900
let her follow me.

65
05:50.190 --> 05:52.380
My parents passed away when I was young,

66
05:52.380 --> 05:53.940
and my relatives weren't wealthy.

67
05:53.940 --> 05:55.740
I wanted to find work in the city,

68
05:56.820 --> 05:58.150
but no one would take me.

69
05:58.290 --> 05:59.920
It wasn't until I came to the Tianxiang Sect

70
05:59.920 --> 06:01.510
that I finally had a full meal.

71
06:01.510 --> 06:03.110
I just wanted a bite to eat.

72
06:03.400 --> 06:05.570
If you're asked

73
06:06.580 --> 06:08.310
to kill someone for a full meal,

74
06:08.310 --> 06:09.340
will you do it?

75
06:15.820 --> 06:16.820
Follow me.

76
06:17.510 --> 06:19.020
As long as you are obedient,

77
06:19.020 --> 06:21.150
I won't make things difficult for you.

78
06:24.460 --> 06:25.320
What about you?

79
06:25.700 --> 06:26.430
I...

80
06:27.110 --> 06:28.630
I didn't want to study,

81
06:29.310 --> 06:30.700
so I ran away from home.

82
06:30.900 --> 06:33.070
If you can't even bear the hardship of studying,

83
06:33.070 --> 06:34.020
this place isn't for you.

84
06:34.020 --> 06:34.630
Leave now.

85
06:39.260 --> 06:40.020
Wait.

86
06:44.110 --> 06:46.040
They are the Sect Master's people?

87
06:48.510 --> 06:49.430
Senior,

88
06:49.580 --> 06:51.750
I've checked the girls' backgrounds.

89
06:51.750 --> 06:52.880
There are no issues.

90
06:53.020 --> 06:54.700
Sect Master gave special instructions.

91
06:54.700 --> 06:56.140
The girls are still useful.

92
06:56.140 --> 06:57.740
They must stay at the branch.

93
06:57.870 --> 06:58.630
Then...

94
06:58.990 --> 06:59.990
let them all stay.

95
07:00.820 --> 07:02.190
A state has its laws,

96
07:02.310 --> 07:03.770
and a family has its rules.

97
07:03.900 --> 07:04.900
From now on,

98
07:05.260 --> 07:06.320
the Tianxiang Sect

99
07:07.020 --> 07:08.460
is your home now.

100
07:09.700 --> 07:11.340
This is a reward from the grandmaster.

101
07:11.340 --> 07:14.270
-Thank you, Grandmaster. -Thank you, Grandmaster.

102
07:45.630 --> 07:47.960
Are you asking about your love life, Miss?

103
07:48.220 --> 07:50.020
Who looks for romance nowadays?

104
07:50.260 --> 07:52.190
I'm here for my financial fortune.

105
07:54.670 --> 07:55.820
You are destined

106
07:55.820 --> 07:57.070
for great wealth.

107
07:57.070 --> 07:59.110
As the saying goes, heaven is vigorous.

108
07:59.110 --> 08:01.940
You just need to strive constantly and work hard.

109
08:02.020 --> 08:03.070
By autumn,

110
08:03.070 --> 08:04.550
a great fortune will fall from the sky.

111
08:04.550 --> 08:05.700
Autumn?

112
08:05.700 --> 08:06.900
I can't wait that long.

113
08:06.900 --> 08:08.310
Just give me a straight answer.

114
08:08.310 --> 08:10.140
I'm going to the casino tonight.

115
08:10.430 --> 08:11.690
Any chance of winning?

116
08:13.340 --> 08:15.200
Miss, your birth element is Wood.

117
08:16.030 --> 08:18.070
You have Indirect Wealth in your chart.

118
08:18.070 --> 08:20.110
You only need a man of the Water element

119
08:20.110 --> 08:23.110
to stir the energy, and wealth will follow naturally.

120
08:24.820 --> 08:27.220
What does a Water-element man look like?

121
08:27.900 --> 08:30.070
Tender or slightly tipsy?

122
08:30.460 --> 08:33.179
Is he like the guy behind you?

123
08:40.270 --> 08:41.390
Do you know how many people

124
08:41.390 --> 08:43.220
envy you for having such a father?

125
08:43.220 --> 08:44.420
Look here, look here!

126
08:45.270 --> 08:46.500
Wang Jiaxian!

127
08:48.340 --> 08:49.500
Why are you here?

128
08:50.430 --> 08:51.070
Jiaxian,

129
08:51.620 --> 08:52.740
why are you here?

130
08:52.820 --> 08:53.730
The last time I saw you

131
08:53.730 --> 08:55.060
was at your wedding.

132
08:55.080 --> 08:56.720
That girl was so nice.

133
08:57.220 --> 08:58.430
This place is boring.

134
08:58.430 --> 08:59.580
Let's go somewhere else.

135
08:59.580 --> 09:02.150
I want to have a drink with this girl.

136
09:13.430 --> 09:15.750
Why did you bring me here?

137
09:16.150 --> 09:17.580
I was going to ask you the same thing.

138
09:17.580 --> 09:18.910
Why are you here?

139
09:18.940 --> 09:21.030
I'm here to meet the mob.

140
09:21.050 --> 09:22.840
I just met a boss upstairs.

141
09:24.700 --> 09:25.550
He is...

142
09:26.150 --> 09:27.950
the Master Swindler.

143
09:35.950 --> 09:37.340
Why were you looking for him?

144
09:37.340 --> 09:38.540
I want to take down...

145
09:39.270 --> 09:41.140
that jerk producer, Tang Yushan.

146
09:41.260 --> 09:43.020
I want to avenge Manzhi.

147
09:43.980 --> 09:45.790
Poor Manzhi.

148
09:46.550 --> 09:47.580
You know what?

149
09:48.100 --> 09:49.340
Tell me about it first.

150
09:49.340 --> 09:51.500
What did this guy do to you?

151
09:51.500 --> 09:53.430
He ruined Ms. He's reputation.

152
09:53.580 --> 09:56.340
Ms. He died for no reason.

153
09:56.500 --> 09:58.270
It must be that guy Tang.

154
09:58.310 --> 09:59.910
Did the police investigate?

155
10:00.480 --> 10:01.270
They did.

156
10:01.300 --> 10:03.610
Suicide or homicide?

157
10:05.950 --> 10:06.700
Suicide.

158
10:06.700 --> 10:07.790
He agreed?

159
10:07.790 --> 10:09.670
He asked me for 100 gold bars.

160
10:09.670 --> 10:11.500
Do I look like a gold bar to you?

161
10:11.500 --> 10:14.230
100 gold bars for a life.

162
10:14.250 --> 10:15.440
No.

163
10:16.220 --> 10:17.580
I don't want his life.

164
10:17.580 --> 10:19.070
But I want him to apologize.

165
10:19.070 --> 10:19.950
I want him to kneel.

166
10:19.950 --> 10:20.620
I want him to repent.

167
10:20.620 --> 10:22.070
I want to stop him from publishing that book.

168
10:22.070 --> 10:23.340
Ms. He is already gone.

169
10:23.340 --> 10:24.940
He wants to publish a book now.

170
10:24.940 --> 10:26.370
He wants to spread rumors about Ms. He.

171
10:26.370 --> 10:28.300
He wants to make money off the dead!

172
10:28.390 --> 10:29.950
He's an animal.

173
10:33.100 --> 10:33.950
Deal.

174
10:34.270 --> 10:35.600
I'll help you with this.

175
10:35.950 --> 10:36.790
For free.

176
10:38.190 --> 10:39.190
Really?

177
10:39.910 --> 10:40.820
By the way,

178
10:40.820 --> 10:42.430
what do you do now?

179
10:43.070 --> 10:43.910
I'll tell you

180
10:43.980 --> 10:45.340
everything later.

181
10:45.980 --> 10:47.790
But you have to promise me one thing first.

182
10:47.790 --> 10:49.100
As long as you can help me,

183
10:49.100 --> 10:50.580
I'll do anything.

184
10:51.070 --> 10:52.270
Words can't express my gratitude.

185
10:52.270 --> 10:52.860
Jiaxian.

186
10:53.740 --> 10:54.910
Just one thing.

187
10:55.340 --> 10:56.460
From now on,

188
10:56.670 --> 10:58.670
don't call me Wang Jiaxian anymore.

189
11:00.580 --> 11:01.430
Remember,

190
11:01.630 --> 11:03.290
call me Shangguan Chengming.

191
11:03.430 --> 11:05.190
And we've never met before.

192
11:05.580 --> 11:06.220
Got it?

193
11:06.430 --> 11:07.100
Shang...

194
11:08.150 --> 11:09.550
You changed your name?

195
11:09.840 --> 11:10.750
Why?

196
11:10.780 --> 11:12.780
So we can get this done for free.

197
11:13.360 --> 11:15.560
And so you don't mess with that mob boss.

198
11:15.600 --> 11:17.600
It's easier to invite trouble than to get rid of it,

199
11:17.600 --> 11:18.570
you know?

200
11:22.820 --> 11:23.500
Alright,

201
11:23.530 --> 11:24.770
then it's settled.

202
11:25.670 --> 11:26.670
Is it?

203
11:28.300 --> 11:29.540
The mob is here.

204
11:31.070 --> 11:31.710
It is.

205
11:32.190 --> 11:32.670
Take care.

206
11:32.670 --> 11:33.500
It's settled.

207
11:33.500 --> 11:34.560
I won't see you out.

208
11:41.310 --> 11:42.500
What do you mean?

209
11:42.620 --> 11:44.500
It's the prey Master Liu has his eyes on.

210
11:44.500 --> 11:45.550
Mr. Fan,

211
11:45.730 --> 11:46.970
a minute ago,

212
11:47.500 --> 11:49.170
Mr. Yang closed this deal

213
11:49.190 --> 11:50.830
with me.

214
11:52.790 --> 11:55.720
You dared to poach clients from your own peers?

215
11:55.750 --> 11:57.390
You are mistaken, Mr. Fan.

216
11:57.620 --> 11:58.860
Nowadays,

217
11:58.890 --> 12:00.430
we believe in fair competition.

218
12:00.430 --> 12:01.500
You asked for too much

219
12:01.500 --> 12:02.670
and scared the client away.

220
12:02.670 --> 12:03.700
Who can you blame for that?

221
12:03.700 --> 12:05.550
Besides, the decision lies with the buyer,

222
12:05.550 --> 12:06.980
not the seller.

223
12:07.550 --> 12:10.080
Don't you even understand this simple logic?

224
12:24.030 --> 12:24.910
Master.

225
12:25.340 --> 12:28.340
Shangguan Chengming definitely knows that Yang guy.

226
12:28.460 --> 12:29.990
He has a guilty conscience.

227
12:31.710 --> 12:33.350
Those 2 little foxes

228
12:33.860 --> 12:35.700
dared to play tricks on me.

229
12:36.900 --> 12:39.100
Wait until they show their true colors.

230
12:39.670 --> 12:40.550
Understood.

231
12:43.390 --> 12:44.180
Mom,

232
12:44.240 --> 12:45.720
keep this money.

233
12:46.390 --> 12:48.150
Your chronic chest pain

234
12:48.390 --> 12:49.950
flares up easily in cold weather.

235
12:49.950 --> 12:51.580
I have asked Manager Liu at the pharmacy

236
12:51.580 --> 12:53.100
to have the medicine boiled

237
12:53.100 --> 12:54.500
and brought to you every week from now on.

238
12:54.500 --> 12:56.820
You must remember to take your medicine on time.

239
12:56.820 --> 12:58.220
Put aside the tailor shop work

240
12:58.220 --> 12:59.790
for now.

241
12:59.790 --> 13:01.270
Don't take on night work, either.

242
13:01.270 --> 13:02.790
From now on, I'll send the money over

243
13:02.790 --> 13:04.670
at the end of every month.

244
13:05.100 --> 13:06.950
Once I'm settled down there,

245
13:07.700 --> 13:09.430
I'll bring you over.

246
13:11.310 --> 13:12.950
You're getting older,

247
13:13.820 --> 13:16.020
yet I can't be by your side to take care of you.

248
13:16.020 --> 13:17.750
Ms. He was such a great actress.

249
13:18.310 --> 13:20.840
How did she end up with a jerk like Tang Yushan?

250
13:21.270 --> 13:22.910
Can also make something of yourself.

251
13:22.910 --> 13:24.670
You're her fan, aren't you?

252
13:24.700 --> 13:27.750
Want to get justice for your idol?

253
13:28.590 --> 13:32.380
I just hope you live well.

254
13:33.340 --> 13:35.620
You must stay well.

255
13:37.190 --> 13:38.030
Mom,

256
13:39.070 --> 13:40.330
take care of yourself.

257
13:47.080 --> 13:48.990
Tang Yushan used to be a punk.

258
13:49.910 --> 13:51.980
After latching onto Ms. He,

259
13:52.310 --> 13:54.100
he suddenly became a producer.

260
13:54.390 --> 13:56.220
Now that Ms. He is gone,

261
13:56.420 --> 13:58.180
he still wants to exploit her

262
13:58.490 --> 14:00.860
by publishing a book.

263
14:01.150 --> 14:02.500
Didn't I tell you

264
14:02.670 --> 14:04.130
to mind your own business?

265
14:04.820 --> 14:06.070
It's not good for you

266
14:06.070 --> 14:07.340
to offend someone like him.

267
14:07.340 --> 14:08.720
But I can't just

268
14:08.910 --> 14:11.570
stand by and watch him profit off her suffering.

269
14:13.300 --> 14:15.340
Do you really have to do this?

270
14:17.630 --> 14:19.160
Yang Xiaozhong came to me.

271
14:19.340 --> 14:20.860
He attended our wedding.

272
14:21.070 --> 14:23.130
I was afraid that if I didn't help him,

273
14:23.390 --> 14:25.050
my identity would be exposed.

274
14:25.550 --> 14:27.190
If you had wanted to silence him,

275
14:27.190 --> 14:28.550
you should have just killed him.

276
14:28.550 --> 14:29.510
I'm not joking with you.

277
14:29.510 --> 14:31.720
Do I look like I'm joking?

278
14:32.030 --> 14:33.910
Yang Xiaozhong has seen you and me.

279
14:33.910 --> 14:35.100
Have you ever thought about

280
14:35.100 --> 14:37.670
what will happen if the sect finds out?

281
14:37.950 --> 14:39.010
What if Sect Master

282
14:39.030 --> 14:40.430
finds out?

283
14:43.900 --> 14:47.230
Don't you think Ms. He is pitiful?

284
14:50.030 --> 14:51.960
There are plenty of pitiful people

285
14:52.030 --> 14:53.550
in this world.

286
14:54.150 --> 14:55.670
Are you going to save them all?

287
14:55.670 --> 14:58.820
We can barely save ourselves.

288
14:59.040 --> 15:01.390
Master Swindler is still keeping an eye on you.

289
15:01.390 --> 15:03.130
If something really happens to you,

290
15:03.130 --> 15:04.130
who will save you?

291
15:04.270 --> 15:05.270
I know the rules.

292
15:05.400 --> 15:07.690
Hiring the Fifth Batou costs money.

293
15:08.990 --> 15:11.540
I have 2 gold bars in my pocket right now.

294
15:11.910 --> 15:13.220
My fee for running a con

295
15:13.220 --> 15:15.340
has always been 3 gold bars.

296
15:16.240 --> 15:17.820
I'll go borrow one right now.

297
15:17.820 --> 15:19.150
I won't owe you.

298
15:20.070 --> 15:21.190
Come back to me

299
15:21.300 --> 15:22.830
when you have enough money.

300
16:17.490 --> 16:19.370
Why have you been following me?

301
16:21.960 --> 16:23.510
Manzhi,

302
16:23.540 --> 16:26.780
I finally found you.

303
16:40.950 --> 16:41.990
Bro,

304
16:42.080 --> 16:43.200
won't we get karma

305
16:43.440 --> 16:45.130
for doing this?

306
16:47.950 --> 16:49.150
A kind word moves a man;

307
16:49.150 --> 16:50.550
a single incense offering moves a ghost.

308
16:50.550 --> 16:52.320
If Ms. He's spirit is in heaven,

309
16:53.010 --> 16:54.340
she will understand us.

310
16:55.070 --> 16:56.030
True.

311
16:58.790 --> 16:59.390
Wait.

312
16:59.390 --> 17:01.220
Did you light the incense before opening the coffin?

313
17:01.220 --> 17:02.000
I did.

314
17:06.130 --> 17:07.609
Fill in a bit more here.

315
17:07.950 --> 17:08.670
Here.

316
17:24.069 --> 17:25.940
Fifth Batou, why are you here?

317
17:27.060 --> 17:28.740
It's useless for you to do this.

318
17:28.740 --> 17:30.340
You know what I'm going to do?

319
17:30.550 --> 17:31.940
People like Tang Yushan

320
17:32.260 --> 17:33.940
don't buy this at all.

321
17:54.430 --> 17:55.430
Speak.

322
18:15.500 --> 18:16.220
Hello?

323
18:16.910 --> 18:17.630
Mr. Tang,

324
18:17.780 --> 18:18.440
it's Zhong.

325
18:18.780 --> 18:19.430
Speak.

326
18:20.500 --> 18:22.060
Something terrible happened.

327
18:22.060 --> 18:22.950
Manzhi...

328
18:23.300 --> 18:24.190
He Manzhi...

329
18:25.020 --> 18:26.300
I saw her.

330
18:28.460 --> 18:30.140
If you're possessed,

331
18:30.500 --> 18:32.380
go pray at a temple, okay?

332
18:33.190 --> 18:34.780
Don't call me.

333
18:35.060 --> 18:36.020
No,

334
18:36.050 --> 18:37.950
there was a rainstorm yesterday, right?

335
18:37.950 --> 18:40.430
I think I saw her ghost.

336
18:40.590 --> 18:42.780
I felt uneasy after waking up today,

337
18:43.540 --> 18:45.060
so I went to the cemetery to check.

338
18:45.060 --> 18:46.300
The thunder yesterday

339
18:46.300 --> 18:48.430
broke the tomb.

340
18:48.870 --> 18:50.530
The tomb was completely open,

341
18:50.590 --> 18:52.120
and the coffin was exposed.

342
18:52.190 --> 18:53.520
The coffin was exposed?

343
18:54.350 --> 18:55.540
You saw it with your own eyes?

344
18:55.540 --> 18:57.740
The coffin was full of hair,

345
18:58.190 --> 18:59.540
jet-black hair.

346
18:59.540 --> 19:01.430
Mr. Tang, she has a grievance.

347
19:02.220 --> 19:03.950
Then please

348
19:04.320 --> 19:06.800
put her coffin back in the grave.

349
19:06.830 --> 19:08.660
Then seal the tomb shut.

350
19:09.390 --> 19:10.910
While you're at it,

351
19:11.460 --> 19:13.500
send a bouquet of flowers to Manzhi for me.

352
19:13.500 --> 19:14.350
Tell her

353
19:14.870 --> 19:16.350
I will always love her,

354
19:17.910 --> 19:18.740
always.

355
19:23.150 --> 19:24.010
It didn't work.

356
19:25.030 --> 19:26.420
I said all that,

357
19:26.440 --> 19:29.240
but he still wouldn't go to her grave to take a look.

358
19:29.870 --> 19:31.220
What did I say?

359
19:31.500 --> 19:32.500
A jerk like him

360
19:32.630 --> 19:34.190
has no sense of shame.

361
19:34.460 --> 19:36.110
He doesn't revere ghosts or gods.

362
19:36.110 --> 19:37.710
He only cares about himself.

363
19:40.870 --> 19:42.070
Not afraid of ghosts?

364
19:44.060 --> 19:45.990
That's because he hasn't seen one.

365
19:54.500 --> 19:55.430
Lin Xiangyu,

366
19:55.540 --> 19:56.740
stop messing around.

367
19:56.980 --> 19:58.740
I won't sign

368
19:59.590 --> 20:00.540
such an unreasonable agreement.

369
20:00.540 --> 20:03.060
Don't forget who made you famous!

370
20:04.630 --> 20:06.460
I've had a hard life since I was a kid.

371
20:06.460 --> 20:07.060
Mr. Tang,

372
20:07.430 --> 20:09.890
I've read the first half of your manuscript.

373
20:10.820 --> 20:12.450
It's absolutely brilliant.

374
20:12.980 --> 20:15.260
But for the second half, could you give us

375
20:15.860 --> 20:17.520
something more sensational?

376
20:19.500 --> 20:20.670
Chief Editor Zheng,

377
20:21.190 --> 20:21.980
I'm sorry.

378
20:23.020 --> 20:24.670
I really don't know how to keep writing.

379
20:24.670 --> 20:26.300
Because whenever I pick up my pen,

380
20:26.300 --> 20:27.300
I think of her.

381
20:27.300 --> 20:28.590
I think of her the moment I pick up my pen.

382
20:28.590 --> 20:30.020
Plus, the recent royalty issues

383
20:30.020 --> 20:31.590
are driving me crazy.

384
20:31.590 --> 20:33.670
I just can't write anymore. I'm sorry.

385
20:33.670 --> 20:34.910
Mr. Tang.

386
20:36.590 --> 20:37.980
Regarding the publishing rights,

387
20:37.980 --> 20:40.540
we are willing to pay 50%

388
20:41.430 --> 20:42.760
above the market price.

389
20:47.220 --> 20:48.220
50%?

390
20:51.590 --> 20:52.720
Chief Editor Zheng,

391
20:52.780 --> 20:54.980
please take back what you just said, okay?

392
20:54.980 --> 20:56.190
Fuxiang Publishing House offered

393
20:56.190 --> 20:57.740
twice what you're paying.

394
20:57.740 --> 20:59.260
Do you know why I turned them down?

395
20:59.260 --> 21:02.100
The Story of My Past with He Manzhi.

396
21:02.130 --> 21:03.630
What price can be put on these words?

397
21:03.630 --> 21:05.260
Can this ever be measured in money?

398
21:05.260 --> 21:06.700
I think the quote is just a formality.

399
21:06.700 --> 21:07.740
It represents

400
21:09.060 --> 21:10.460
respect for Manzhi.

401
21:10.460 --> 21:11.430
Please say no more.

402
21:11.430 --> 21:13.060
I feel this is an insult to art,

403
21:13.060 --> 21:13.740
an insult to me,

404
21:13.740 --> 21:15.590
and an insult to my wife, okay?

405
21:15.590 --> 21:16.200
Mr. Tang,

406
21:16.220 --> 21:18.680
I will absolutely show my utmost sincerity.

407
21:18.950 --> 21:19.700
It's just that

408
21:19.700 --> 21:22.360
I need to discuss this with our president again.

409
21:22.370 --> 21:23.180
Easy.

410
21:32.380 --> 21:33.260
My friend.

411
21:34.350 --> 21:35.540
You are still young.

412
21:35.650 --> 21:38.380
There are some things you don't see clearly.

413
21:39.350 --> 21:40.880
Have you ever thought about

414
21:40.920 --> 21:43.480
how much wealth it could create

415
21:43.500 --> 21:46.700
if you convince the president

416
21:46.730 --> 21:47.950
to buy up the rights to this sure-to-become-hit novel—

417
21:47.950 --> 21:50.780
the film production rights,

418
21:50.780 --> 21:52.700
and even the sequel film rights,

419
21:52.700 --> 21:53.780
all bundled together,

420
21:53.780 --> 21:56.260
at a very reasonable price?

421
21:56.260 --> 21:57.590
And if this succeeds,

422
21:57.780 --> 21:58.780
do you think

423
21:59.110 --> 22:01.150
I'd forget my friends?

424
22:21.630 --> 22:22.360
What is this?

425
22:23.690 --> 22:25.650
Can you guys do anything right?

426
22:29.420 --> 22:31.700
I will pay you back every single penny.

427
22:32.350 --> 22:33.830
But you won't take away

428
22:34.830 --> 22:37.300
even a shred of my dignity.

429
23:09.260 --> 23:10.110
Who is it?

430
23:11.190 --> 23:12.390
Stop messing around.

431
23:17.990 --> 23:20.090
♪ Night rain taps the window, dampening the silk canopy ♪

432
23:20.370 --> 23:23.340
♪ The face in the mirror still wears its old look ♪

433
23:23.780 --> 23:28.080
♪ I trace an eyebrow to hide the tear in my eye ♪

434
23:29.650 --> 23:30.590
Who's there?

435
23:29.690 --> 23:35.350
♪ My love, tell me if I'm cold or burning hot ♪

436
23:35.740 --> 23:37.110
I see you!

437
23:35.970 --> 23:40.600
♪ Rouge is as red as blood plasma ♪

438
23:41.610 --> 23:46.340
♪ Stained on lips, yet sealed deep in your heart ♪

439
23:47.340 --> 23:52.100
♪ This red thread loops round my neck ♪

440
23:53.050 --> 23:57.600
♪ It tightens more; even broken, our bond endures ♪

441
23:58.770 --> 24:01.590
♪ We crazily love each other ♪

442
24:02.100 --> 24:04.850
♪ We're a pair in this life ♪

443
24:05.170 --> 24:07.670
♪ Lying in one bed; sharing one coffin when dead ♪

444
24:07.740 --> 24:12.590
♪ Turn to ash and dust, mixed as one instead ♪

445
24:14.380 --> 24:16.600
♪ Don't look back or panic ♪

446
24:17.490 --> 24:19.850
♪ Right here, by your side ♪

447
24:20.300 --> 24:22.510
♪ Press to your back and breathe your scent ♪

448
24:21.380 --> 24:22.500
Won't sleep, huh?

449
24:23.120 --> 24:27.500
♪ With cold long nails, I loose your robe ♪

450
24:23.220 --> 24:24.350
Wanna die?

451
24:24.460 --> 24:25.260
Close it!

452
24:27.630 --> 24:28.670
I said close...

453
24:28.700 --> 24:31.370
♪ We crazily love each other ♪

454
24:32.220 --> 24:34.590
♪ Through every life, we remain as a pair ♪

455
24:35.330 --> 24:37.850
♪ You can't flee, and I can't leave ♪

456
24:38.280 --> 24:45.260
♪ I must speak to you about this bitter grudge ♪

457
25:15.230 --> 25:17.290
[Die]

458
25:59.550 --> 26:02.140
♪ We crazily love each other ♪

459
26:02.470 --> 26:05.300
♪ We're a pair in this life ♪

460
26:05.430 --> 26:08.060
♪ Lying in one bed; sharing one coffin when dead ♪

461
26:08.280 --> 26:12.550
♪ Turn to ash and dust, mixed as one instead ♪

462
26:14.720 --> 26:16.990
♪ Don't look back or panic ♪

463
26:17.790 --> 26:20.210
♪ Right here, by your side ♪

464
26:20.360 --> 26:22.960
♪ Press to your back and breathe your scent ♪

465
26:23.660 --> 26:27.960
♪ With cold long nails, I loose your robe ♪

466
26:29.180 --> 26:31.950
♪ We crazily love each other ♪

467
26:32.510 --> 26:34.960
♪ Through every life, we remain as a pair ♪

468
26:35.570 --> 26:38.210
♪ You can't flee, and I can't leave ♪

469
26:38.410 --> 26:41.960
♪ I must speak to you about this bitter grudge ♪

470
26:54.060 --> 26:56.700
Yushan.

471
26:57.310 --> 26:59.660
Don't you miss me?

472
27:02.740 --> 27:04.700
Then why did you

473
27:05.840 --> 27:07.760
want to kill me?

474
27:25.210 --> 27:26.930
So easily frightened.

475
28:05.950 --> 28:06.950
Thank you,

476
28:07.690 --> 28:11.060
♪ Rouge is as red as blood plasma ♪

477
28:07.950 --> 28:08.910
Fourth Batou.

478
28:11.750 --> 28:16.240
♪ Stained on lips, yet sealed deep in your heart ♪

479
28:17.480 --> 28:22.300
♪ This red thread loops round my neck ♪

480
28:21.260 --> 28:23.300
I heard you never set traps.

481
28:23.700 --> 28:27.720
♪ It tightens more; even broken, our bond endures ♪

482
28:23.980 --> 28:25.300
Why help me?

483
28:25.350 --> 28:27.110
Who said I never set traps?

484
28:28.220 --> 28:30.630
Who wouldn't want to enforce justice on behalf of Heaven?

485
28:29.570 --> 28:31.810
♪ You can't flee, and I can't leave ♪

486
28:31.390 --> 28:33.390
That's also why Sect Master

487
28:32.550 --> 28:40.310
♪ I must speak to you about this bitter grudge ♪

488
28:33.460 --> 28:35.720
let me join the Tianxiang Sect back then.

489
28:37.390 --> 28:38.740
You're quite naive.

490
28:39.590 --> 28:41.500
You joined the Tianxiang Sect

491
28:41.900 --> 28:43.300
just to enforce justice.

492
28:45.260 --> 28:46.260
For so many years,

493
28:48.020 --> 28:51.220
all the people in the sect have thought about is how to harm others

494
28:51.220 --> 28:52.550
and swindle money.

495
28:55.150 --> 28:56.750
You are different from them.

496
29:35.950 --> 29:36.980
Get closer.

497
29:40.280 --> 29:41.760
Closer.

498
29:48.700 --> 29:49.740
Master Chang.

499
29:51.980 --> 29:53.610
I'm good here.

500
29:53.630 --> 29:55.390
If you're too far,

501
29:55.720 --> 29:58.050
the victim won't feel it.

502
30:16.890 --> 30:19.680
When I opened the coffin for the autopsy just now,

503
30:19.700 --> 30:22.630
I noticed signs of a zombie transformation.

504
30:23.190 --> 30:24.220
But don't be afraid.

505
30:24.220 --> 30:25.740
I've set up a formation.

506
30:25.910 --> 30:26.700
It's safe.

507
30:26.880 --> 30:28.390
Once I perform a ritual,

508
30:28.420 --> 30:30.640
you can rest easy.

509
30:31.540 --> 30:35.190
The victim's resentment should dissipate.

510
30:50.630 --> 30:56.380
♪ He Manzhi bears unjust grief ♪

511
30:54.700 --> 30:55.260
Master!

512
30:55.870 --> 30:56.660
Master!

513
30:56.730 --> 30:59.880
♪ Wed Tang Yushan by wrong fate ♪

514
31:00.250 --> 31:03.130
♪ Tang Yushan, a wolfish spouse ♪

515
31:03.700 --> 31:05.850
♪ Took her life and severed all kin ties ♪

516
31:05.020 --> 31:07.150
I can't do this job!

517
31:06.560 --> 31:09.350
♪ Yin and mortal realms hold this trial ♪

518
31:07.150 --> 31:08.430
My cultivation isn't strong enough

519
31:08.430 --> 31:09.500
to suppress it!

520
31:09.500 --> 31:11.190
But you have to save me.

521
31:09.600 --> 31:15.850
♪ My husband Tang Yushan is a beast ♪

522
31:11.190 --> 31:11.780
You have to save me.

523
31:11.780 --> 31:14.670
How about I invite my mentor

524
31:14.670 --> 31:15.460
to take a look?

525
31:15.460 --> 31:17.460
Go invite him right now.

526
31:16.350 --> 31:20.600
♪ He stole my life away ♪

527
31:17.460 --> 31:19.740
Okay.

528
31:19.740 --> 31:21.300
Let's go.

529
31:20.620 --> 31:27.260
♪ Redress He Manzhi's unjust wrongs ♪

530
31:37.220 --> 31:39.020
Mr. Tang, please be patient.

531
31:39.020 --> 31:41.080
My mentor will definitely have a way.

532
31:45.630 --> 31:47.110
Performing this ritual

533
31:47.920 --> 31:50.680
will probably exhaust all my cultivation.

534
31:51.540 --> 31:53.110
Mentor, if it consumes so much of your cultivation,

535
31:53.110 --> 31:54.910
we might as well not do this ritual.

536
31:54.910 --> 31:55.640
Please, no!

537
31:55.910 --> 31:56.500
Mentor.

538
31:56.500 --> 31:57.010
No.

539
31:57.220 --> 31:57.980
Master.

540
31:58.030 --> 31:59.460
I heard you were coming.

541
31:59.480 --> 32:00.510
Look, I've spent my money

542
32:00.510 --> 32:02.560
setting up the formation again.

543
32:02.590 --> 32:04.020
You have to do this.

544
32:04.700 --> 32:06.300
Money is not an issue.

545
32:06.300 --> 32:07.430
You must help me.

546
32:08.220 --> 32:10.880
The sage puts himself last and rises to the fore;

547
32:11.150 --> 32:13.150
he sets himself aside, and his life endures.

548
32:13.150 --> 32:15.410
It means putting others before oneself.

549
32:16.910 --> 32:18.990
I'll help you with this.

550
33:08.020 --> 33:08.630
Break!

551
33:27.950 --> 33:28.870
Break the ground.

552
33:28.870 --> 33:29.800
Open the coffin.

553
33:45.520 --> 33:46.190
Master.

554
33:48.980 --> 33:49.700
Hair.

555
33:50.500 --> 33:51.280
Hair.

556
33:51.310 --> 33:52.830
Just as I expected.

557
33:53.540 --> 33:56.110
Ms. He's resentment has turned into pus and blood.

558
33:56.110 --> 33:58.350
Soon, it will gather into a soul

559
33:58.550 --> 33:59.690
and become a vengeful spirit.

560
33:59.690 --> 34:02.410
Mr. Tang, you found me just in time.

561
34:02.830 --> 34:03.830
But

562
34:04.350 --> 34:06.300
I'll need you for the next step.

563
34:07.460 --> 34:08.460
Me?

564
34:35.820 --> 34:37.929
You can't leave, Mr. Tang!

565
34:39.020 --> 34:40.870
Only a close relative

566
34:40.870 --> 34:42.870
can bring Ms. He's soul back to her body.

567
34:42.870 --> 34:43.659
Mr. Tang,

568
34:43.980 --> 34:45.580
go hold her hand now.

569
34:45.580 --> 34:48.179
No matter what happens, don't let go.

570
34:48.179 --> 34:49.460
I can't hold it!

571
34:49.489 --> 34:51.510
Mr. Tang, we can't give up halfway!

572
34:51.530 --> 34:52.420
Mr. Tang!

573
34:52.540 --> 34:53.429
Mr. Tang!

574
34:56.989 --> 34:58.110
Yushan.

575
34:58.500 --> 35:00.390
Help!

576
35:01.750 --> 35:03.460
Ms. He's soul has returned.

577
35:03.750 --> 35:06.540
Mr. Tang, if you have anything to say to her,

578
35:06.570 --> 35:08.130
say it now.

579
35:08.350 --> 35:10.580
I have nothing to say to her.

580
35:10.580 --> 35:12.500
What should I say?

581
35:12.500 --> 35:14.390
Say whatever will put her at ease.

582
35:14.950 --> 35:17.540
But remember, you must tell the truth.

583
35:21.790 --> 35:23.710
Manzhi.

584
35:23.830 --> 35:25.540
Stop thinking about me.

585
35:26.020 --> 35:27.910
I'm doing fine here.

586
35:27.910 --> 35:29.020
Hurry up and reincarnate.

587
35:29.020 --> 35:31.680
Let's be husband and wife again in the next life!

588
35:33.310 --> 35:34.910
Why did you kill me?

589
35:35.390 --> 35:36.270
Why?

590
35:36.270 --> 35:38.710
I...

591
35:39.100 --> 35:40.180
I...

592
35:40.180 --> 35:42.660
I told you to tell the truth.

593
35:43.130 --> 35:44.720
Is there something else you haven't said?

594
35:44.720 --> 35:46.880
Nothing.

595
35:47.100 --> 35:48.350
Tang Yushan,

596
35:48.580 --> 35:49.710
tell me now.

597
35:50.230 --> 35:52.620
Why on earth did you kill me?

598
35:52.830 --> 35:55.310
I'll tell you.

599
36:00.060 --> 36:01.430
Master.

600
36:01.580 --> 36:05.270
Let us have a private talk.

601
36:05.390 --> 36:07.310
Give me some space, okay?

602
36:08.190 --> 36:08.900
Mentor.

603
36:15.230 --> 36:16.120
Don't go too far!

604
36:16.120 --> 36:17.310
Don't go too far!

605
36:17.570 --> 36:18.370
Don't worry.

606
36:22.950 --> 36:24.580
Don't go any further!

607
36:24.610 --> 36:25.880
You two just stay there!

608
36:25.880 --> 36:26.740
Right there!

609
36:26.850 --> 36:27.910
Go ahead and speak!

610
36:30.390 --> 36:31.350
Manzhi,

611
36:31.460 --> 36:32.950
I'm sorry.

612
36:33.140 --> 36:34.980
I didn't mean it back then.

613
36:38.310 --> 36:39.830
Reincarnate well.

614
36:40.180 --> 36:41.430
I'll repay you...

615
36:41.580 --> 36:43.140
in my next life.

616
36:43.310 --> 36:44.980
I'll be your beast of burden

617
36:45.350 --> 36:49.430
in my next life. Please let me go.

618
36:56.400 --> 36:58.000
What are these people doing?

619
36:58.100 --> 36:59.760
They don't seem to be our guys.

620
37:01.170 --> 37:02.570
Where is Yang Xiaozhong?

621
37:02.660 --> 37:03.100
Him?

622
37:03.540 --> 37:06.230
Yang Xiaozhong always talked about exposing this animal.

623
37:06.230 --> 37:08.210
Do you think he arranged for these people?

624
37:08.210 --> 37:09.080
Oh no.

625
37:14.820 --> 37:16.550
Are you even human?

626
37:16.700 --> 37:18.450
Do you have any humanity?

627
37:20.100 --> 37:22.060
You wouldn't let He Manzhi go

628
37:22.140 --> 37:23.780
when she was alive!

629
37:23.800 --> 37:27.530
Now that she's dead, you still won't let her rest in peace, will you?

630
37:27.740 --> 37:28.490
Fine then.

631
37:28.860 --> 37:30.270
Don't you want to take pictures?

632
37:30.270 --> 37:30.950
Come on!

633
37:31.710 --> 37:32.620
Take pictures of me!

634
37:32.620 --> 37:33.500
Come on!

635
37:34.020 --> 37:35.750
Take all the pictures you want!

636
37:35.990 --> 37:38.070
Take all the pictures you want!

637
37:41.140 --> 37:43.020
Manzhi!

638
37:44.620 --> 37:47.180
I'm so sorry for you!

639
37:47.430 --> 37:49.180
I didn't give you a good life

640
37:49.210 --> 37:51.690
when you were alive.

641
37:51.740 --> 37:54.800
And I can't even let you rest in peace after you're dead,

642
37:54.820 --> 37:56.570
Manzhi!

643
38:01.240 --> 38:03.060
Mr. Tang, there's no need for this.

644
38:03.060 --> 38:04.310
I hear you've recently

645
38:04.310 --> 38:06.460
been writing a biography of Ms. He.

646
38:06.660 --> 38:08.060
Ms. He's fans have been

647
38:08.060 --> 38:09.660
watching this book closely.

648
38:09.750 --> 38:11.430
When do you plan to publish it?

649
38:11.430 --> 38:12.660
Rumor has it that due to gambling,

650
38:12.660 --> 38:14.230
your financial situation has been poor.

651
38:14.230 --> 38:15.270
Are you facing great difficulties

652
38:15.270 --> 38:16.800
with the publishing funds?

653
38:19.620 --> 38:21.310
I don't care

654
38:21.540 --> 38:22.940
if everyone slanders me.

655
38:23.390 --> 38:24.270
But

656
38:24.790 --> 38:26.390
all of you, remember this.

657
38:26.660 --> 38:27.870
I will definitely

658
38:28.790 --> 38:30.230
publish this book.

659
38:30.260 --> 38:32.180
I'll publish it

660
38:32.200 --> 38:34.150
even if I have to sell

661
38:34.230 --> 38:36.270
everything I own!

662
38:36.270 --> 38:38.790
There are so many things in this book

663
38:38.790 --> 38:41.100
that I want to say to Manzhi.

664
38:41.790 --> 38:43.830
She can't hear them anymore.

665
38:43.830 --> 38:46.140
Do you have any thoughts of adapting it into a movie?

666
38:46.140 --> 38:47.350
Of course, I do!

667
38:48.710 --> 38:49.950
Listen up!

668
38:49.950 --> 38:52.790
Not only will I adapt this book into a movie,

669
38:52.790 --> 38:54.270
but I'll also make the movie

670
38:54.270 --> 38:55.020
become

671
38:55.020 --> 38:57.660
a milestone in Chinese film history!

672
38:58.100 --> 38:59.270
He Manzhi,

673
38:59.580 --> 39:00.710
I love you!

674
39:00.910 --> 39:03.980
I will definitely make this movie well

675
39:04.180 --> 39:05.950
and finish it for you!

676
39:06.140 --> 39:08.430
Yang Xiaozhong meant well but did a bad thing,

677
39:08.430 --> 39:10.090
paving the way for this beast.

678
39:12.180 --> 39:12.950
Here is...

679
39:14.430 --> 39:15.980
the gold bar I owed you.

680
39:19.460 --> 39:20.310
You gave up?

681
39:22.390 --> 39:24.790
I couldn't just beat that bastard to death.

682
39:26.660 --> 39:27.990
I saw He Manzhi's mother

683
39:28.660 --> 39:30.060
after the movie that day.

684
39:31.430 --> 39:32.830
She was delirious

685
39:34.020 --> 39:35.620
and mistook me for He Manzhi.

686
39:37.020 --> 39:38.950
The old lady still doesn't believe

687
39:39.660 --> 39:40.950
her daughter is dead.

688
39:42.540 --> 39:43.430
Tell me,

689
39:44.660 --> 39:46.390
is it worth it

690
39:48.350 --> 39:50.210
to seek justice for a dead person?

691
39:58.790 --> 39:59.910
Maybe...

692
40:02.950 --> 40:04.910
for some of the living,

693
40:06.710 --> 40:08.660
it's the only thing worth doing.

694
40:16.570 --> 40:19.930
These 3 gold bars are the payment you gave me.

695
40:20.310 --> 40:21.230
We're even.

696
40:22.950 --> 40:23.910
Now,

697
40:24.580 --> 40:25.830
I'm giving them to you

698
40:26.710 --> 40:28.110
to hire you to work for me.

699
40:29.790 --> 40:30.580
I'll take

700
40:32.460 --> 40:33.350
this deal.

701
40:42.600 --> 40:44.860
[In the next episode]

702
40:44.880 --> 40:46.420
Are you filming a movie?

703
40:46.500 --> 40:47.980
Who should I act with?

704
40:48.120 --> 40:49.330
He Manzhi.

705
40:49.390 --> 40:50.110
He Man...

706
40:50.390 --> 40:51.600
He Manzhi?

707
40:53.620 --> 40:54.580
Okay.

708
40:54.890 --> 40:56.500
Attention, all departments.

709
40:56.500 --> 40:57.230
Rolling.

710
40:57.230 --> 40:57.910
Ah.

711
40:58.230 --> 41:01.250
Look how beautiful I am in the mirror.

712
41:01.660 --> 41:02.500
But...

713
41:02.500 --> 41:03.610
I'm sorry, Director.

714
41:03.610 --> 41:05.730
Do we have to film this movie?

715
41:05.910 --> 41:07.100
We must do it.

716
41:07.100 --> 41:09.100
I want everyone to witness

717
41:09.130 --> 41:11.130
He Manzhi's return.

718
41:11.540 --> 41:13.230
I'll make this movie...

719
41:13.230 --> 41:15.180
You want me to summon souls?

720
41:15.500 --> 41:16.830
A smash hit.

721
41:17.060 --> 41:18.100
Necklace.

722
41:18.270 --> 41:19.070
Soul seizure.

723
41:19.620 --> 41:21.280
Once she wears that necklace,

724
41:21.310 --> 41:22.430
Manyu

725
41:22.640 --> 41:22.980
will be possessed.

726
41:22.980 --> 41:24.310
But I know

727
41:25.840 --> 41:27.030
this is not me.
